              {heroTitle}
            </h1>
            <div
              class="mt-2 flex w-full max-w-96 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 font-[divenire,sans-serif] text-sm leading-5 font-light tracking-widest text-pretty"
            >
              <div class="text-md w-full text-center text-white">
                <em>DESIGNER noun(1)</em>&nbsp; ◦ &nbsp;A PERSON WHO DEVISES OR
                EXECUTES DESIGNS, ESPECIALLY ONE WHO CREATES FORMS, STRUCTURES,
