                  Point me in a direction and I'll figure it out
                </li>
                <li class="shrink-0 whitespace-nowrap">
                  I believe in low ego and iteration
                </li>
              </ul>
              <ul class="flex gap-16 pr-16 text-lg">
                <li class="shrink-0 whitespace-nowrap">
                  I'm a senior product designer
                </li>
                <li class="shrink-0 whitespace-nowrap">
                  I've worked as an independent contributor and managed teams
                </li>
                <li class="shrink-0 whitespace-nowrap">
                  I enjoy co-creating with engineers and product managers
                </li>
                <li class="shrink-0 whitespace-nowrap">
                  Point me in a direction and I'll figure it out
                </li>
                <li class="shrink-0 whitespace-nowrap">
                  I believe in low ego and iteration
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div> -->
          <!-- marquee ends -->
          <!-- ChevronsDown at the bottom center -->
          <div
            class="absolute bottom-8 left-1/2 z-20 flex -translate-x-1/2 flex-col items-center"
          >
            <ChevronsDown client:visible />
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <!-- Section 2: Main content with custom dark background -->
      <section
        class="flex min-h-screen w-full snap-start flex-col items-center justify-between text-white"
        style="background-color: rgb(17, 17, 17);"
      >
        <div
          class="flex w-full flex-1 flex-col items-center justify-center p-4"
        >
          <div
            class="mx-auto w-full max-w-3xl font-mono text-sm font-light md:text-base"
          >
            <!-- What I'm up to -->
            <div class="mb-6 md:mb-8">
              <h2
                class="mb-2 text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-gray-100 uppercase md:text-sm"
