                Currently
              </h2>
              <ul
                class="experience-list text-xs leading-tight font-thin text-pretty text-gray-200 md:text-sm"
              >
                <style>
                  ul li::before {
                    content: none !important;
                  }
                </style>
                <li class="mb-1">
                  <span aria-hidden="true">–</span>
