                    Founding product designer at Gero Labs building <a
                      class="text-blue-400 underline"
                      href="https://arceus.legal/">arceus.legal</a
                    >, an AI-native law firm
                  </span>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <!-- Work Examples Table -->
            <div class="mt-8 mb-6 md:mt-0 md:mb-8">
              <h2
                class="mb-2 text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-gray-100 uppercase md:text-sm"
              >
                Work Examples
              </h2>
              <div class="overflow-x-auto pb-1">
                <WorkExamples />
              </div>
            </div>
            <!-- Previous Section -->
            <div class="mb-6 md:mb-8">
              <div class="mb-6 md:mb-8">
                <h2
                  class="mb-2 text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-gray-100 uppercase md:text-sm"
                >
                  Previous
                </h2>
                <ul
                  class="experience-list text-xs leading-tight font-thin text-pretty text-gray-200 md:text-sm"
                >
                  <style>
                    ul li::before {
                      content: none !important;
                    }
                  </style>
                  <li class="mb-2">
                    <span aria-hidden="true">–</span>
                    <span>
                      <a
                        class="text-blue-400 underline"
                        href="https://about.gitlab.com/gitlab-duo/"
                        >GitLab Duo</a
                      > [generative AI + agent platform] with the <a
                        class="text-blue-400 underline"
                        href="https://about.gitlab.com/direction/ai-powered/"
                        >AI-Powered team</a
                      > at GitLab
                    </span>
                  </li>
                  <li class="mb-2">
                    <span aria-hidden="true">–</span>
                    <span>
                      Cloud Development Environments and browser-based IDEs
                      [GitLab <a
                        class="text-blue-400 underline"
                        href="https://about.gitlab.com/direction/create/remote_development/workspaces/"
                        >Workspaces</a
                      > and <a
                        class="text-blue-400 underline"
                        href="https://about.gitlab.com/direction/create/remote_development/web_ide/"
                        >Web IDE</a
                      >]
                    </span>
                  </li>
                  <li class="mb-2">
                    <span aria-hidden="true">–</span>
                    <span
                      >Enterprise security scanning tools [Synopsys R&D]</span
                    >
                  </li>
                  <li class="mb-2">
